{"id":"789eea8538e194e6","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-boolean-circuit.md","title":"Boolean Circuit","display":"df-boolean-circuit — Boolean Circuit","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-boolean-circuit","aliases":["72-df-boolean-circuit"],"display":"df-boolean-circuit — Boolean Circuit","depends_on":["[[72-df-propositional-syntax]]"],"source_location":"Pudlak, Chapter VIII, sections 9.3.1-9.3.5; printed pp. 612-613; PDF pp. 624-625; explicit gate encoding supplied locally","source_statement_status":"source-statement-compared","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_proof_status":"not-applicable-definition; local well-definedness and referenced interfaces checked","round2_verification_status":"definition-contract-checked","verification_status":"definition-contract-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-boolean-circuit"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-boolean-circuit</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-boolean-circuit — Boolean Circuit"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d6da6d3f3489ef90\" href=\"?note=d6da6d3f3489ef90\" title=\"72-df-propositional-syntax\">72-df-propositional-syntax</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Pudlak, Chapter VIII, sections 9.3.1-9.3.5; printed pp. 612-613; PDF pp. 624-625; explicit gate encoding supplied locally"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"source-statement-compared"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-applicable-definition; local well-definedness and referenced interfaces checked"},{"key":"round2_verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{PV}\">\\(\\mathsf{PV}\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d6da6d3f3489ef90\" href=\"?note=d6da6d3f3489ef90\" title=\"72-df-propositional-syntax\">72-df-propositional-syntax</a> 的命题变量集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{PV})\">\\(X\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{PV})\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a:X\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(a:X\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>门的标签 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf g_0,\\mathsf g_1,\\mathsf g_2,\\mathsf g_3,\\mathsf g_4\">\\(\\mathsf g_0,\\mathsf g_1,\\mathsf g_2,\\mathsf g_3,\\mathsf g_4\\)</span> 两两不同；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 为待检验的集合编码，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\omega\">\\(m\\in\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 为有限函数。对满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Circuit}_X(C)\">\\(\\operatorname{Circuit}_X(C)\\)</span> 的输入，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C=\\langle m,g\\rangle\">\\(C=\\langle m,g\\rangle\\)</span> 的分量唯一；求值递归中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in X\">\\(p\\in X\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\in\\{0,1\\}\">\\(b\\in\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>。单输出门固定为最后一个门。</li>\n<li>求值和输出投影只在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Circuit}_X(C)\">\\(\\operatorname{Circuit}_X(C)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a:X\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(a:X\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> 下定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\min,\\max\">\\(\\min,\\max\\)</span> 为布尔值上的合取、析取运算；此节点以门数计 circuit size。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Circuit}_X(C)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\exists m\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\exists g\\;\\Bigl(C=\\langle m,g\\rangle\\land\\operatorname{dom}(g)=m\\land g:m\\to\\operatorname{ran}(g)\\land\n\\forall i&lt;m\\;\\Bigl(&amp;g(i)\\in\\{\\langle\\mathsf g_0,p\\rangle:p\\in X\\}\n\\cup\\{\\langle\\mathsf g_4,0\\rangle,\\langle\\mathsf g_4,1\\rangle\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\langle\\mathsf g_1,j\\rangle:j&lt;i\\}\n\\cup\\{\\langle t,j,k\\rangle:t\\in\\{\\mathsf g_2,\\mathsf g_3\\},\\ j,k&lt;i\\}\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Circuit}_X(C)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\exists m\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\exists g\\;\\Bigl(C=\\langle m,g\\rangle\\land\\operatorname{dom}(g)=m\\land g:m\\to\\operatorname{ran}(g)\\land\n\\forall i&lt;m\\;\\Bigl(&amp;g(i)\\in\\{\\langle\\mathsf g_0,p\\rangle:p\\in X\\}\n\\cup\\{\\langle\\mathsf g_4,0\\rangle,\\langle\\mathsf g_4,1\\rangle\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\langle\\mathsf g_1,j\\rangle:j&lt;i\\}\n\\cup\\{\\langle t,j,k\\rangle:t\\in\\{\\mathsf g_2,\\mathsf g_3\\},\\ j,k&lt;i\\}\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nv_{C,a}(i)&amp;=a(p)&amp;&amp;\\quad(g(i)=\\langle\\mathsf g_0,p\\rangle),\\\\\nv_{C,a}(i)&amp;=b&amp;&amp;\\quad(g(i)=\\langle\\mathsf g_4,b\\rangle),\\\\\nv_{C,a}(i)&amp;=1-v_{C,a}(j)&amp;&amp;\\quad(g(i)=\\langle\\mathsf g_1,j\\rangle),\\\\\nv_{C,a}(i)&amp;=\\min(v_{C,a}(j),v_{C,a}(k))&amp;&amp;\\quad(g(i)=\\langle\\mathsf g_2,j,k\\rangle),\\\\\nv_{C,a}(i)&amp;=\\max(v_{C,a}(j),v_{C,a}(k))&amp;&amp;\\quad(g(i)=\\langle\\mathsf g_3,j,k\\rangle).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nv_{C,a}(i)&amp;=a(p)&amp;&amp;\\quad(g(i)=\\langle\\mathsf g_0,p\\rangle),\\\\\nv_{C,a}(i)&amp;=b&amp;&amp;\\quad(g(i)=\\langle\\mathsf g_4,b\\rangle),\\\\\nv_{C,a}(i)&amp;=1-v_{C,a}(j)&amp;&amp;\\quad(g(i)=\\langle\\mathsf g_1,j\\rangle),\\\\\nv_{C,a}(i)&amp;=\\min(v_{C,a}(j),v_{C,a}(k))&amp;&amp;\\quad(g(i)=\\langle\\mathsf g_2,j,k\\rangle),\\\\\nv_{C,a}(i)&amp;=\\max(v_{C,a}(j),v_{C,a}(k))&amp;&amp;\\quad(g(i)=\\langle\\mathsf g_3,j,k\\rangle).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦ C⟧_a=v_{C,a}(m-1),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{size}(C)=m,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Var}(C)=\\{p:\\exists i&lt;m\\;(g(i)=\\langle\\mathsf g_0,p\\rangle)\\}\n\\quad(\\operatorname{Circuit}_X(C)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦ C⟧_a=v_{C,a}(m-1),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{size}(C)=m,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Var}(C)=\\{p:\\exists i&lt;m\\;(g(i)=\\langle\\mathsf g_0,p\\rangle)\\}\n\\quad(\\operatorname{Circuit}_X(C)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>来源：Chapter VIII，§9.3.1–9.3.5，印刷页 612–613，PDF 页 624–625 使用布尔电路及其大小；本节点把所用标准有限 DAG 表示显式展开，原书没有给出同样的门编号定义。</li>\n<li>每条边只指向编号更小的门，所以按门号递归唯一给出求值；各门标签互斥且覆盖全部合法门。输入变量条件完全放在形式定义中。</li>\n<li>这里的大小是门数；电路的二进制编码长度可多出门索引的对数因子。不能不加说明把线性门数界读成线性位数界。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-propositional-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"d6da6d3f3489ef90","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-propositional-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-propositional-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"d6da6d3f3489ef90","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf{PV}$ 是 [[72-df-propositional-syntax]] 的命题变量集合，$X\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{PV})$，$a:X\\to\\{0,1\\}$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{PV}","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{PV})","display":false},{"tex":"a:X\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf g_0,\\mathsf g_1,\\mathsf g_2,\\mathsf g_3,\\mathsf g_4","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"m\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"g","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Circuit}_X(C)","display":false},{"tex":"C=\\langle m,g\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"i<m","display":false},{"tex":"j,k<i","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in X","display":false},{"tex":"b\\in\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Circuit}_X(C)","display":false},{"tex":"a:X\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\min,\\max","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Circuit}_X(C)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\exists m\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\exists g\\;\\Bigl(C=\\langle m,g\\rangle\\land\\operatorname{dom}(g)=m\\land g:m\\to\\operatorname{ran}(g)\\land\n\\forall i<m\\;\\Bigl(&g(i)\\in\\{\\langle\\mathsf g_0,p\\rangle:p\\in X\\}\n\\cup\\{\\langle\\mathsf g_4,0\\rangle,\\langle\\mathsf g_4,1\\rangle\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\{\\langle\\mathsf g_1,j\\rangle:j<i\\}\n\\cup\\{\\langle t,j,k\\rangle:t\\in\\{\\mathsf g_2,\\mathsf g_3\\},\\ j,k<i\\}\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nv_{C,a}(i)&=a(p)&&\\quad(g(i)=\\langle\\mathsf g_0,p\\rangle),\\\\\nv_{C,a}(i)&=b&&\\quad(g(i)=\\langle\\mathsf g_4,b\\rangle),\\\\\nv_{C,a}(i)&=1-v_{C,a}(j)&&\\quad(g(i)=\\langle\\mathsf g_1,j\\rangle),\\\\\nv_{C,a}(i)&=\\min(v_{C,a}(j),v_{C,a}(k))&&\\quad(g(i)=\\langle\\mathsf g_2,j,k\\rangle),\\\\\nv_{C,a}(i)&=\\max(v_{C,a}(j),v_{C,a}(k))&&\\quad(g(i)=\\langle\\mathsf g_3,j,k\\rangle).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"⟦ C⟧_a=v_{C,a}(m-1),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{size}(C)=m,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Var}(C)=\\{p:\\exists i<m\\;(g(i)=\\langle\\mathsf g_0,p\\rangle)\\}\n\\quad(\\operatorname{Circuit}_X(C)).","display":true}],"bytes":3120,"backlinks":[{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-388","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-boolean-circuit|df-boolean-circuit — Boolean Circuit]]"},{"id":"1aa3ad8d378fa3a5","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Circuit}_X,⟦ C⟧_a,\\operatorname{size}(C)$ 如 [[72-df-boolean-circuit]]；$d$ 遍历有限子句序列，$|d|$ 表示其固定编码位数。"}],"outgoing":["d6da6d3f3489ef90"]}